<h1>Create New Entity from Selection</h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Edit &gt; Create New Entity From Selection</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span class="Command">Create New Entity From Selection</span> <span lang="EN-GB">removes the visible selection and generates a copy of it as separate entity. This command is grayed if there is no selection or it is not visible. It is applicable to compound entities  scan data, meshes, point clouds, and polylines.</span> <span class="Command">Create New Entity From Selection</span> <span lang="EN-GB">has the same behaviour as if you</span> <u style="text-decoration:none;"><span class="Command" style="text-decoration:none;">Cut</span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">a selection and</span> <u style="text-decoration:none;"><span class="Command" style="text-decoration:none;">Paste As New Entity</span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">it into the current document.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">The names of the new entities created from selection have the names of their types  Scan, Scan 1, Scan 2, etc. for scan data, Mesh, Mesh 1, Mesh 2, etc. for meshes, Grid points, Grid points 1, Grid points 2, etc. for point clouds, and Polyline, Polyline 1, Polyline 2, etc. for polylines.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">You may apply this command to wholly selected entities as well as parts of them. For example, if you have selected entire <i>Scan0</i> and part of <i>Scan1</i>, after applying the command you will get the following entities in the scene  <i>Scan</i> (which contains only the selected points from <i>Scan1</i>), <i>Scan1</i> (which contains only the non selected points from <i>Scan1</i>), and <i>Scan 1</i> (which contains full copy of the removed <i>Scan0</i>).</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/create_new_entity.jpg" width="295px" height="68px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">&#160;</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If you select <i>Scan</i> and <i>Scan1</i> and apply</span> <span class="Command">Combine Selected Entities</span><span lang="EN-GB">, you will get the same object as <i>Scan1</i> before using</span> <span class="Command">Create New Entity From Selection</span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">this command to divide an entity into separate entities.</span></p>
